	(text "System-5 IO panel card Rev A, one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Decode         PORT 4 DECODE AND STROBES\n  sheet 3  Output         OUT 4: LATCH, EIGHT LEDS, TWO TIL311 HEX DISPLAYS\n  sheet 4  Input          INP 4 (AND LOAD DATA): EIGHT TOGGLE SWITCHES\n  sheet 5  Control        INPUT BUTTON, RUN AND LOAD, ONE DMA IN PER PRESS, Q LED\n  sheet 6  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, POWER LED\n\nRedrawn from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "edeb3735-fa21-5191-8764-a1fdc23abc1f"))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
